/*
  Localizable.strings (Japanese) — Fan Control integration for DynamicNotch.

  Plain UTF-8 source. Merge these entries into DynamicNotch's ja.lproj/Localizable.strings.
  NOTE: the .strings files shipped inside DynamicNotch.app are compiled (binary/UTF-16 plists);
  edit the project's source .strings (or the String Catalog, if the project uses one)
  and let Xcode compile them, do not edit the files inside the built app.
  Keys are the English text used in SwiftUI literals (Text("…"), Button("…"), …).
  Interpolated keys use SwiftUI's format specifiers: String -> %@.
  Not localized on purpose: RPM, °C/°F, SMC keys, sensor names from SensorCatalog,
  fan names reported by the SMC, and FanControlError messages (English, from FanControlCore).
  Aggregate sensor names (SensorAggregator, e.g. "CPU (max)") are localized below.
*/


